MooseTime Data Deletion Request
To request deletion of personal information associated with a feedback or support submission, email moosetime.support@gmail.com.
Include enough information to identify the submission, such as the email address used, approximate submission date, or subject.
Anonymous submissions may not be identifiable and therefore may not be possible to delete individually.
Certain information may be retained where necessary for legal, security, fraud-prevention, or dispute-resolution purposes.
